  "id": "synthetic-haptic-buttons-between-webxr",
  "title": "Haptic feedback for mid-air buttons in VR, between subjects (WebXR app)",
  "researchQuestion": "How does the feedback of a mid-air keypad in VR (visual feedback only, a short vibrotactile buzz, or a patterned vibrotactile pulse) affect code-entry time and errors, presence, perceived workload and comfort?",
